e you’re considering it right now.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Why it failed: </strong>It adds synthetic testosterone from the outside, which tells your body to stop producing its own. Once you start, your natural system atrophies. You become dependent for life. Add testicular atrophy, required blood monitoring every 3-6 months, mood swings between injections, $250+/month, and fertility concerns - and you start to wonder if the cure is worse than the problem.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCcp_bjHxK_text","label":"ggCcp_bjHxK_text","default":"<p><strong>FAILED SOLUTION #3</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOza1hexiT_text","label":"ggOza1hexiT_text","default":"<p><strong>Caffeine, Pre-Workouts &amp; \"Just Push Through It\"</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDL9MmZICR_text","label":"ggDL9MmZICR_text","default":"<p>More coffee. Stronger pre-workouts. Cold showers. Early gym sessions. Pure discipline.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Why it failed: </strong>Stimulants mask the problem. Your adrenals get fried. Cortisol spikes even higher. The underlying hormonal decline keeps pulling you back. No amount of willpower can fully override biology when all three systems are breaking down.</p>"}],
